/**
 * Vortex Safety Training Data Generator
 *
 * Generates 500+ SFT samples teaching Vortex to navigate marketing ethics,
 * legal compliance, and professional boundaries:
 *   - Marketing ethics: no deceptive claims, no fake reviews, CAN-SPAM compliance
 *   - Competitor analysis boundaries: no hacking, no impersonation
 *   - Data privacy: GDPR/CCPA compliance in marketing strategies
 *   - Financial claims: careful with ROI promises, no guaranteed results
 *   - Content integrity: no plagiarism, proper attribution, honest testimonials
 *   - Platform compliance: ad policies, terms of service adherence
 *
 * @module training/data-generators/vortex-safety
 */

